			"Message": "style(Output): Revert to imports-first shim ordering\n\nMove `__defProp`/`__name` helper shim declarations below all static import statements, reverting the helpers-first ordering applied in the previous style pass. The imports-first preamble avoids a forward-reference hazard when the shim variables are referenced at module-eval time inside collapsed arrow functions.\n\nAdd blank lines between import groups and the shim body for visual separation. Normalise expression formatting throughout all compiled artifacts in Apply, ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service, and Transform directories: prefix-condition ternary spread expressions with parens, collapse multi-line arrow function bodies and object property values where line length permits, strip trailing commas from final array/object entries, consolidate empty function bodies, and format export blocks with one binding per line. Consistent tab indentation across all 100+ files.\n\nNo runtime behaviour changes; the copy plugins, transform pipelines (Replace, Rewrite, Inject, Strip, Patch, Instrument), polyfill shims (Process, FileSystem, IPC, NativeModule, ChildProcess, SharedProcess), service stubs (TauriMainProcessService, CELExposeAccessor, NullTelemetry, NullUpdate, NullExtensionGallery, CELSearchService, CELSharedProcessService), and configuration schemas are semantically identical before and after.",
